WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
With our relationship, why should we be called boss?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,200
From now on, you and I will treat each other as brothers and not be so arrogant.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,400
This is Professor Qiu from the History Department of Jiangcheng University

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,200
In Jiangcheng, we are good at identifying antiques.

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,600
I specially invited him to come over today to inspect the wine vessel together.

6
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:11,600
Excuse me, Mr. Lin

7
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,600
Professor Qiu, please sit down. The things are right here.

8
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:24,900
Brother, try this tea, make sure you haven’t drunk it before

9
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,100
Oh, it’s another Western product that only you have here.

10
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:32,340
Absolutely uptown

11
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,740
What kind of tea is this?

12
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:34,940
I can't taste it

13
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,940
It seems to include many styles of tea flavors

14
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:37,940
Seriously top quality

15
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,340
This tea is called green oil tea

16
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:41,940
It’s the name of a good thing that can only be found in a small overseas country.
